WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:03.912
(fast, dramatic violin music)

00:00:04.952 --> 00:00:07.189
- [Narrator] In Northern
Italy, there is a city

00:00:07.189 --> 00:00:09.522
with a very special history.

00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:12.809
This is Cremona.

00:00:12.809 --> 00:00:15.349
This is the home of Stradivari,

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:18.527
maker of some of the world's
most coveted instruments.

00:00:18.527 --> 00:00:20.860
This is The City of Violins.

00:00:22.809 --> 00:00:25.976
(lively violin music)

00:01:08.589 --> 00:01:12.422
(fast, dramatic violin music)

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.227
(chiming)

